{
  "title": "A Returner's Magic Should Be Special",
  "description": "The worst calamity humankind has ever faced... \n\nShadow Realms have ravaged the earth and decimated almost everyone in their way. The survival of humanity hinges upon the success of just six mages, including analytic fighter Desir Herrman. The remaining heroes make one final stand to end the bloodshed...but to no avail. Desir closes his eyes on what should be the end of his life—only to open them and see the beginning of his school days?! Desir has returned thirteen years back to the past, where he’s been given another chance. A chance to see the loved ones he lost, a chance to meet his fellow warriors again, and a chance to save the world…! \n\n(Source: Yen Press)\n\nStatus: completed\nTags: Action, Adventure, Arrogant Characters, Calm Male Lead, Demons, Discrimination, Drama, Dungeon, Ensemble Cast, Fantasy, Fantasy World, Harem, Historical, Level System, Overpowered Protagonist, Reincarnated in the Past, Reincarnation, Romantic Subplot, School Life, Shounen, Smart Male Lead, Subtle Romance, Swordplay, Training, Adapted to Anime, Age Regression, Age Transformation, Annoying Character, Based on a Novel, Based on a Web Novel, Changing Fate, Comedy, Elaborate, Europe, Female Lead, Full Color, Harem Subtext, Longstrip, Lost Civilization, Love-Hate Relationship, Mages, Magic, Magic Items, Magic School, Male Lead, Male Protagonist, Manhwa, Martial Arts, Muscular Female, Nobility, School, Sci-Fi, Second Chance, Supernatural, Time Manipulation, Time Travel, War, Weak to Strong, Web Comic, Art Evolution, Comedic Facial Expressions, Conspiracy, Espionage, European Ambience, Female Harem, Friendly Male Lead, Gore, Love Triangle, Ojou-sama, Protagonist Strong from the Start, Time Rewind, Tsundere, Unusual First Meeting",
  "artist": "Wookjakga",
